# TAB.md (example)

A project pins this file at its root; cursortab injects it into completion
context. Keep it short and high-signal — conventions, custom commands, helpers.

## Custom CLI
`compute` — our infra CLI.
- `compute runtime start --gpu <t4|a100> --timeout <dur>`  -> prints a session id
- `compute exec "<session-id>" -- <cmd>`                   -> run a command in the session

## Conventions
- Wrap python one-liners in bash via the `run_py "<code>"` helper (see lib/py.sh).
- Pipeline steps are bash functions composed with shell pipes.
